{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2017-biology-08","exam":"MDEET","year":2017,"subject":"biology","number":8,"points":4,"unitId":"circulation","unitLabel":"순환·혈액","topic":"심실·심박·심근","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["circulation","neuro"],"stem":"그림은개의왼쪽별신경절(stellate ganglion)과오른쪽별신경절을\n순차적으로전기자극했을때, 심박수와좌심실수축기압의변화를\n나타낸것이다.\n이에대한설명으로옳은것만을<보기>에서있는대로고른것은?\n(단, 자극의크기는동일하다.)\n<보기>\nㄱ. 왼쪽별신경절을자극했을때, 자극전후의심박출량에는\n변화가없다.\nㄴ. 좌심실심근에대한신경지배는왼쪽별신경절이오른쪽\n별신경절보다우세하다.\nㄷ. 왼쪽별신경절의자극에동방결절은반응하지않았다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":["fig-03"],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":4,"acceptedAnswers":[4],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":474,"height":522,"region":0,"bbox":[73.955,68.372,189.6,208.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-08/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":281,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,350.372,310.4,112.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-08/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":811,"height":3,"region":0,"bbox":[-0.045,506.372,324.4,1.2],"role":"option","overlayTextItemIds":[],"optionNumber":5,"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-08/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":3,"sourceRect":[429.645,577.228,758.256,1084.406],"width":328.611,"height":507.178,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[73.955,68.372,189.6,208.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[13.955,350.372,310.4,112.4],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-03","bbox":[-0.04